"NIP-17 messages. When switching to a smaller (or fully private) write-set, "
"publish the new relay list <em>first</em>, then disable the old relays — "
"otherwise other clients can't follow the move. NoorNote automatically "
"rebroadcasts your profile and follow-list to any newly-added write-relay."

